Job Title: Digital Marketing & SEO Specialist 

Company: Medease RCM

Location:

Melthype Plaza, Opposite KFC, Commercial Market, Chandni Chowk, Rawalpindi *(On-site)*

Key Responsibilities:

Design visually engaging content for social media and digital campaigns

Manage content creation and scheduling across social media platforms

Develop and implement digital marketing strategies to increase online reach

Execute SEO activities: keyword research, on-page & off-page optimization, link building

Write and publish SEO-optimized blog content to drive organic traffic

Monitor, analyze, and report on campaign and website performance using analytics tools

Requirements:

Proven experience in digital marketing, SEO, and social media management (people with medical billing seo will be preferred)

Proficiency in graphic design tools (e.g., Canva, Photoshop, Illustrator)

Strong understanding of web analytics tools (Google Analytics, Google Search Console, etc.)

Experience in content/blog writing with SEO best practices

Ability to work independently and meet deadlines

*Preferred Qualifications:*
Experience in the healthcare industry will be preferred but not required.

*Salary:*

Market Competitive

*How to Apply:*

📧 Email your resume to: admin@medeasercm.com1a:T4c4,Cloudtek is urgently looking for the following resources:

𝟏. Full Stack Developer - 𝐎𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐞
Part-Time - 4 Hours - Strong expertise in .NET and Java, with excellent communication skills. Experience with Python would be a plus.

𝟐. Sales Lead - 𝐎𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐞/𝐇𝐲𝐛𝐫𝐢𝐝
Dynamic Sales Professionals to drive revenue growth and expand market presence through platforms like Upwork, LinkedIn, and B2B engagements.

𝟑. Sales Executives - 𝐎𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐞
The role focuses on client outreach, service promotion, and developing strong business relationships in close coordination with our internal team. Prior experience or knowledge in medical sales will be an added advantage.


To apply, please email your resume to the address mentioned below 𝐨𝐧𝐥𝐲 𝐢𝐟 𝐲𝐨𝐮 𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐬𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐞𝐝 𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐬, specifying the job title you are applying for in the subject line.

