Timings: 6 pm to 2 am1b:T4b9,Job Title: Graphic Design Intern
Location: Islamabad (On-site)
Job Type: Full-time | Monday to Saturday | 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM

Company Overview
Unity Films Pvt Ltd., a leading media production company in Islamabad, is seeking a female Graphic Design Intern to support its Creative & Design Department. This role offers valuable hands-on experience in content creation for film, television, and digital platforms.

Responsibilities
Assist in designing graphics for social media, print, and digital campaigns
Support creative projects while maintaining brand consistency
Collaborate with team members on visual concepts and design execution
Revise designs based on feedback and requirements

Requirements

Female candidates based in Islamabad (on-site role)
Bachelor’s degree in Graphic Design, Media Arts, or related field
Proficiency in Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, Canva
Creative mindset with strong attention to detail
Recent graduates or Virtual University students preferred

What We Offer

Professional and supportive work environment
Hands-on industry experience with real projects
Opportunity for a full-time position based on performance

Apply at: careers@unityfilms.net1c:T611,Job Title: YouTube Script Writer
Job Type: Full-Time, Remote

Company Overview:
We are a fast-growing content creation company specializing in producing engaging, high-quality YouTube videos across multiple genres. As we expand, we are seeking a talented and creative YouTube Script Writer to join our remote team. If you have a passion for storytelling and strong writing skills, we’d love to hear from you.

Position Summary:
The YouTube Script Writer will be responsible for developing informative, entertaining, and compelling scripts tailored for YouTube audiences. You will collaborate with the video production team to ensure each script aligns with the brand’s tone, visual direction, and audience expectations.

Key Responsibilities:

Write clear, engaging, and audience-focused scripts for various YouTube niches.
Conduct thorough research to ensure content accuracy and relevance.
Generate creative ideas for new video topics and formats.
Revise scripts based on team feedback.
Meet deadlines and manage multiple projects effectively.

Required Qualifications:

Proven scriptwriting for YouTube 
Strong writing skills with the ability to match tone and style to different audiences.
Strong research and storytelling abilities.
Self-motivated, with excellent time management and communication skills.

Important:
Applications without a sample script will not be considered. Please include a sample YouTube video script to demonstrate your writing style and content adaptability.

Apply at: careers@unityfilms.net1d:Ta41,🚀  𝐖𝐞’𝐫𝐞 𝐇𝐢𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠: 𝐒𝐞𝐧𝐢𝐨𝐫 𝐏𝐇𝐏 𝐃𝐞𝐯𝐞𝐥𝐨𝐩𝐞𝐫 (𝐎𝐩𝐞𝐧𝐂𝐚𝐫𝐭 + 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐯𝐞𝐥 𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭)
Location: 𝐊𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐜𝐡𝐢 (𝐅𝐮𝐥𝐥 𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐞 & 𝐎𝐧-𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐞)
Working Hours: 4:00 𝐀𝐌 – 1:00 𝐏𝐌 (𝐌𝐨𝐧 𝐭𝐨 𝐅𝐫𝐢), Pakistan Time. 
                          5:00 𝐀𝐌 - 10:00 𝐀𝐌 (𝐒𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐝𝐚𝐲) 

𝐒𝐔𝐌𝐌𝐀𝐑𝐘: 
We’re seeking a skilled #PHP Developer with proven expertise in #OpenCart (mandatory) and #Laravel. You’ll manage our e-commerce platform while building custom web applications, ensuring scalable, secure, and high-performing solutions.

✅ 𝐑𝐨𝐥𝐞 & 𝐑𝐞𝐬𝐩𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐞𝐬

🔷 𝐎𝐩𝐞𝐧𝐂𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐃𝐞𝐯𝐞𝐥𝐨𝐩𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭
Manage and enhance OpenCart (#frontend & #backend), integrate payment/shipping solutions and third-party tools, and optimize performance & #SEO.

🔷𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐯𝐞𝐥 𝐃𝐞𝐯𝐞𝐥𝐨𝐩𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭
Develop robust back-end systems, #APIs, and #databases; integrate with existing workflows.

🔷𝐏𝐇𝐏 𝐃𝐞𝐯𝐞𝐥𝐨𝐩𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭
Write clean, scalable code, troubleshoot, debug, and follow best practices in testing, #CI/#CD, and version control.

🔷𝐂𝐨𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐛𝐨𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 & 𝐒𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐲
Align solutions with business goals, support marketing/ #automation initiatives, and recommend tech improvements.

 
🎯 𝐑𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐢𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬
5+ years professional experience in #PHP development.

Expertise in #OpenCart (#themes, extensions, APIs, #customization, and performance optimization) is a mandatory requirement.

Proven #Laravel experience (applications, APIs, databases).

Solid knowledge of MySQL, MVC, JavaScript, jQuery, and AJAX.

Experience with Git, CI/CD and agile workflows.

Strong problem-solving skills; able to work independently & in teams.



✨ 𝐏𝐞𝐫𝐤𝐬 & 𝐁𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐟𝐢𝐭𝐬

 🌟 Competitive salary 

 🌟 Paid leaves 

 🌟 Health insurance coverage

 🌟 Overtime pay on gazette holidays

 🌟 Work with a fast-growing international e-commerce brand

 🌟 Exposure to global industry practices and events

